  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/SRPCKX6z/Simple-Lower-Grass-Sides.png\" alt=\"标题图片\"></p><p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/JamieCubed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/K8KGTMJW/Twitter.png\" alt=\"推特\"></a>   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjamiecubed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/GhLJbcqt/Ko-Fi.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi赞助平台\"></a>   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fJamieCubed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/44SgqRb5/Modrinth.png\" alt=\"Modrinth平台\"></a></p><h2>🌻 介绍：</h2><p>修改草方块及其他类似方块的纹理，使草叶纹理向下延伸。本资源包专为兼容我的其他作品而设计，包括<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易花草植被</a>及所有其他资源包。</p><p>理论上可兼容其他修改相同方块的资源包，因为本包仅调整原版侧边纹理。</p><p>无需安装Optifine。</p><h2>🔍 包含方块：</h2><ul>\n<li>草方块</li>\n<li>灰化土</li>\n<li>覆雪草方块</li>\n<li>草径</li>\n<li>菌丝体</li>\n<li>诡异菌岩</li>\n<li>绯红菌岩</li>\n</ul><h2>🎨 探索其他作品：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-default\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp重制版原版纹理</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fwisps-colourful-wildflowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp缤纷野花</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易花草植被</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">极简花草植被</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易低矮草侧纹</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffancy-full-block-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精美全草方块</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-nether-bricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">匠心下界砖</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-rustic-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易粗粝玻璃</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fraven-phantoms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">乌鸦幻翼</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-breeze-rod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">优化微风权杖</a></li>\n</ul><h2>🤔 常见问题：</h2><p><strong>问：如何安装资源包？</strong><br>\n答：请参照<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fblog%252fhow-to-install-minecraft-texture-packs-4615399%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">本指南</a>。</p><p><strong>问：会推出基岩版吗？</strong><br>\n答：目前暂无基岩版移植计划。</p><p><strong>问：允许他人移植至基岩版吗？</strong><br>\n答：禁止第三方移植我的作品。</p><p><strong>问：能否添加某某功能？</strong><br>\n答：或许可以！欢迎留言建议。</p><p><strong>问：发现漏洞！</strong><br>\n答：请留言反馈，我会尽快修复。</p><p><strong>问：支持某某版本吗？</strong><br>\n答：理论上支持主流现代版本，但旧版Minecraft不在支持范围内。</p><p><strong>问：能否加入整合包？</strong><br>\n答：欢迎使用！需标注作者信息且禁止声称是个人作品。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjamie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/7c463234-3d14-4a86-9788-f3a6d45a2488.png\" alt=\"Bisect主机服务\"></a></p>",
